ove\"\r}","event":"GAoEvent"},"key":"event"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_38"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"eventData":"{\r  \"para\": {\r    \"speed\": 999,\r    \"npc\": \"\",\r    \"direction\": 3,\r    \"lockAnim\": \"\",\r    \"heroType\": 3,\r    \"points\": [\r      {\r        \"y\": -21.73,\r        \"x\": -6.30\r      }\r    ],\r    \"lockDirection\": 0\r  },\r  \"action\": \"npcMove\"\r}","event":"GAoEvent"},"key":"event"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_39"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"eventData":"{\r  \"para\": {\r    \"speed\": 999,\r    \"npc\": \"\",\r    \"direction\": 3,\r    \"lockAnim\": \"\",\r    \"heroType\": 4,\r    \"points\": [\r      {\r        \"y\": -22.44,\r        \"x\": -7.70\r      }\r    ],\r    \"lockDirection\": 0\r  },\r  \"action\": \"npcMove\"\r}","event":"GAoEvent"},"key":"event"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_40"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"time":300,"type":"time"},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1.5,"addImg":"","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"bg","x":-500,"transTime":300,"y":-125,"bright":1,"scaleY":1.5,"img":"bgblack"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"贫民伊曼纽尔","text":"[show]真了不起。没想到你们真有这样的实力。非常感谢你们帮助了贫民街。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1.5,"addImg":"","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"bg","x":-500,"y":-125,"bright":1,"scaleY":1.5,"img":"bgblack"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0.4,"scaleX":1.5,"addImg":"","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"bg","x":-500,"transTime":300,"y":-125,"bright":1,"scaleY":1.5,"img":"bgblack"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2b","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara2","x":340,"y":-180,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2b","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara2","x":340,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]嘿嘿……这都是小意思啦。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2b","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara2","x":340,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1.5,"addImg":"","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"bg","x":-500,"transTime":300,"y":-125,"bright":1,"scaleY":1.5,"img":"bgblack"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"贫民伊曼纽尔","text":"[show]也该好好感谢我敬爱的哥哥，感谢你身后的大市集真的愿意出手相助；虽然这份小小的帮助，恐怕夹杂了其他什么利益因素。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"文员拉比尔","text":"[show]伊曼纽尔，别再用那阴阳怪气的口吻说话了。你可以不信任我，但请你相信埃迪蒂小姐。她是真心想要帮助贫民街走出困局的。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"贫民伊曼纽尔","text":"[show]少说漂亮话了！我在这里看过的事情比你多得多。呵，大市集说要帮忙？他们说过几次了？哪次不是为了给图洛德立人设，减轻舆论压力，做做样子？[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_7"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"贫民伊曼纽尔","text":"[show]那些商人会运一大堆空箱子过来，对外宣传他们花大价钱支援了贫民街！这种事情发生了不止一次！如果你亲眼看见过这些，你就会知道什么口吻才真叫阴阳怪气！[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_8"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"文员拉比尔","text":"[show]我知道的事情不比你少，我也从未遗忘那些可憎的虚伪者。但我相信埃迪蒂小姐这次是真的愿意帮助贫民街的！我的到来，还有两位契约者的出手相助，便是最好的证明！[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_9"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"贫民伊曼纽尔","text":"[show]一次小小的弥补，并不能说明什么。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_10"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"贫民伊曼纽尔","text":"[show]不过，我也没有敌视你们的意思。就像那些从大市集过来的治安队一样，他们用生命守护着贫民街的安全，我们永远欢迎这些真心愿意帮助我们的人。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_11"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"贫民伊曼纽尔","text":"[show]我相信时间会证明一切，如果你所说的话是真的，那贫民街也绝不会忘记你们的恩情。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_12"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"文员拉比尔","text":"[show]那就让时间去证明吧，我们接着谈正事。我想光消灭一个蛇窟，很难解决贫民街的安全问题，你觉得接下来应该怎么做？[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_13"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"贫民伊曼纽尔","text":"[show]确实，要打赢这场战争，可不是一朝一夕就能达成的。附近聚集的蛇群，依旧需要治安队前去剿灭。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_14"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"贫民伊曼纽尔","text":"[show]如果用之前的装备进行战斗，那伤亡一定会很惨重。而且这边的人手也不太够，要他们主动出击……恐怕够呛。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_15"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"文员拉比尔","text":"[show]人手那边我会通知埃迪蒂小姐的，让她看看有没有多余的人手可以安排。至于装备的问题……我也有点头绪。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_16"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"文员拉比尔","text":"[show]大市集有个自称是“捕蛇猎人”的狼人。他自称是专业的魔爪蛇猎人，应该有好办法。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_17"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"贫民伊曼纽尔","text":"[show]嗯，很好。那就请你们多多努力了。需要我们做什么，就请告诉我们吧。我们会尽力配合的。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_18"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"文员拉比尔","text":"[show]……[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_19"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"文员拉比尔","text":"[show]和我来大市集吧，伊曼纽尔。我会给你找一份好住处好工作的。你没必要一直留在这里。你的能力可以让你拥有更好的生活。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_20"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"贫民伊曼纽尔","text":"[show]我都说过多少次了。在贫民街……在这座新四指村变好之前，我是不会离开的。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_21"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"文员拉比尔","text":"[show]我不反对你为贫民街奉献，但你没必要把全部的人生都奉献出去。你去大市集定居，也不影响你帮助这里的人改善生活啊。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_22"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"贫民伊曼纽尔","text":"[show]这是你的道路，不是我的。我更喜欢和这些人在一起。我亲眼看着他们的努力，亲眼看着他们建造自己避世的安全港，亲眼看着他们的日子越过越好。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_23"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"文员拉比尔","text":"[show]伊曼纽尔……[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_24"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"贫民伊曼纽尔","text":"[show]话就说到这吧。哥哥你能过来帮忙，我很开心，但我不会跟你走的。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_25"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"贫民伊曼纽尔","text":"[show]好了……我该去做我的事情了，你们也该去做你们的了。有缘，再会。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_26"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1.5,"addImg":"","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"bg","x":-500,"y":-125,"bright":1,"scaleY":1.5,"img":"bgblack"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1.5,"addImg":"","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"bg","x":-500,"transTime":300,"y":-125,"bright":1,"scaleY":1.5,"img":"bgblack"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"","text":"[show]（伊曼纽尔转身离开了。）[l][cm][hide]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_48"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"eventData":"{\r  \"para\": {\r    \"display\": false,\r    \"heroType\": 0,\r    \"uid\": \"Emmanuel_c3_area4_1\"\r  },\r  \"action\": \"npcDisplay\"\r}","event":"GAoEvent"},"key":"event"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_49"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"time":500,"type":"time"},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_50"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"eventData":"{\r  \"para\": {\r    \"speed\": 1,\r    \"npc\": \"\",\r    \"direction\": 4,\r    \"lockAnim\": \"\",\r    \"heroType\": 1,\r    \"points\": [],\r    \"lockDirection\": 0\r  },\r  \"action\": \"npcMove\"\r}","event":"GAoEvent"},"key":"event"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_51"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"eventData":"{\r  \"para\": {\r    \"speed\": 1,\r    \"npc\": \"\",\r    \"direction\": 4,\r    \"lockAnim\": \"\",\r    \"heroType\": 2,\r    \"points\": [],\r    \"lockDirection\": 0\r  },\r  \"action\": \"npcMove\"\r}","event":"GAoEvent"},"key":"event"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_52"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"eventData":"{\r  \"para\": {\r    \"speed\": 1,\r    \"npc\": \"\",\r    \"direction\": 4,\r    \"lockAnim\": \"\",\r    \"heroType\": 3,\r    \"points\": [],\r    \"lockDirection\": 0\r  },\r  \"action\": \"npcMove\"\r}","event":"GAoEvent"},"key":"event"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_53"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"eventData":"{\r  \"para\": {\r    \"speed\": 1,\r    \"npc\": \"\",\r    \"direction\": 4,\r    \"lockAnim\": \"\",\r    \"heroType\": 4,\r    \"points\": [],\r    \"lockDirection\": 0\r  },\r  \"action\": \"npcMove\"\r}","event":"GAoEvent"},"key":"event"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_27"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1.5,"addImg":"","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"bg","x":-500,"transTime":300,"y":-125,"bright":1,"scaleY":1.5,"img":"bgblack"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"文员拉比尔","text":"[show]唉……好吧，我们该去做我们的事情了。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_28"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1.5,"addImg":"","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"bg","x":-500,"y":-125,"bright":1,"scaleY":1.5,"img":"bgblack"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0.4,"scaleX":1.5,"addImg":"","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"bg","x":-500,"transTime":300,"y":-125,"bright":1,"scaleY":1.5,"img":"bgblack"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara2","x":340,"y":-180,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara2","x":340,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]你之前也劝过伊曼纽尔离开贫民街吗？[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_29"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara2","x":340,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1.5,"addImg":"","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"bg","x":-500,"transTime":300,"y":-125,"bright":1,"scaleY":1.5,"img":"bgblack"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"文员拉比尔","text":"[show]是啊，那故事很长，回去再和你们聊吧。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_30"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"文员拉比尔","text":"[show]接下来，我先回去和埃迪蒂小姐汇报情况。然后劳驾两位契约者去问问恩塔尔先生，看看他能不能提供对付魔爪蛇的装备。这样可以吗？[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_31"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1.5,"addImg":"","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"bg","x":-500,"y":-125,"bright":1,"scaleY":1.5,"img":"bgblack"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0.4,"scaleX":1.5,"addImg":"","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"bg","x":-500,"transTime":300,"y":-125,"bright":1,"scaleY":1.5,"img":"bgblack"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara2","x":340,"y":-180,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara2","x":340,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]没关系，交给我们吧！[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_32"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara2","x":340,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1.5,"addImg":"","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"bg","x":-500,"transTime":300,"y":-125,"bright":1,"scaleY":1.5,"img":"bgblack"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"文员拉比尔","text":"[show]好，拜托了，我会在大市集等你们的。[l][cm][hide]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_42"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1.5,"addImg":"","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"fore","x":-500,"y":-125,"bright":1,"scaleY":1.5,"img":"bgblack"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1.5,"addImg":"","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"fore","x":-500,"transTime":300,"y":-125,"bright":1,"scaleY":1.5,"img":"bgblack"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_43"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"eventData":"{\r  \"para\": {\r    \"display\": false,\r    \"heroType\": 0,\r    \"uid\": \"lbe_c3_area4_1\"\r  },\r  \"action\": \"npcDisplay\"\r}","event":"GAoEvent"},"key":"event"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_44"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"eventData":"{\r  \"para\": {},\r  \"action\": \"followLeader\"\r}","event":"GAoEvent"},"key":"event"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1.5,"addImg":"","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"fore","x":-500,"transTime":300,"y":-125,"bright":1,"scaleY":1.5,"img":"bgblack"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}],"des":"回到贫民街，向贫民伊曼纽尔回报任务。"}